WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.900
An inhaled drug carrier may behave well during

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.760
preparation yet fail at the first real delivery step.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.511
My master's research explores dexamethasone-loaded

00:00:16.511 --> 00:00:20.222
niosomes and proniosomes, including surfactant and

00:00:20.222 --> 00:00:22.003
cholesterol composition.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:31.439
Particle size, formulation chemistry and loading

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:34.745
measurements belong to a reproducible analytical

00:00:34.745 --> 00:00:37.017
programme before aerosol testing.

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:46.635
A vesicle must withstand aerosol generation before

00:00:46.635 --> 00:00:49.610
deposition is even a meaningful question.

00:00:54.258 --> 00:00:57.328
Planned aerosol assessment asks about output,

00:00:57.328 --> 00:01:00.806
distribution and the fraction that reaches a target

00:01:00.806 --> 00:01:03.398
region, not just the vial formulation.

00:01:09.508 --> 00:01:12.880
The thesis is ongoing. I am showing the research

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:13.301
design

00:01:13.301 --> 00:01:17.023
and what must be measured, not claiming encapsulation

00:01:17.023 --> 00:01:17.163
or

00:01:17.163 --> 00:01:18.542
therapeutic success.
